Specifically, the following are ported from or derived from that project
and are reproduced here under the same licence:

  * the preprocessing pipeline
    (modules/sensing/image_preprocessing/src/image_preprocessor.cpp)
  * compute_top_crop_2_1
    (modules/common/include/common/utils.hpp)
  * the ImageNet normalisation constants and the fixed warped-to-world
    matrix V (modules/models/src/inference.cpp)
  * the output decoding for AutoDrive, AutoSteer and AutoSpeed, including
    non-maximum suppression (modules/models/src/*.cpp)
  * the cross-track-error and heading formulas
    (modules/safety_guardian/fusion/src/lateral_fusion.cpp)
  * the IDM longitudinal planner
    (modules/safety_guardian/planning/src/longitudinal_planning.cpp)
  * the ego-path band rendering and its acceleration colour scale
    (modules/visualization/src/visual_interface.cpp)

The ONNX model weights are downloaded at runtime from that repository and
are not redistributed here.

The temporal tracking in tracking.py is NOT a port. Upstream uses particle
filters; this project uses constant-velocity Kalman filters to the same end.

Camera calibration values in calibration.py were measured by this project
for one specific 70mai A800S unit and are not from upstream.
